Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.54,0:00:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要点咖啡外带  洋娃娃  你也要吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would you like some more coffee, baby-doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.92,0:00:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用了  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm fine. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能叫你洋娃娃吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, see, I can't pull of "baby doll," can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.75,0:00:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  从那次甜甜嘴事件  我们已经学到教训了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I think we learned that from the "sugar lips" incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.13,0:00:14.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去点茶来喝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna get some tea. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.14,0:00:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小亲亲  你好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How you doing, pumpkin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行不通\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:21.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩看起来越来越好了呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So it looks like it's going really well for you two, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.52,0:00:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  真的很好  其实我正想要菲比搬来我家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. Really well. In fact, I'm gonna ask Phoebe to move in with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.27,0:00:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  你觉得呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.69,0:00:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这真是太棒了  你什么时候要问她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think that it's so great. When are you gonna ask her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.86,0:00:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚  你先别透露啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tonight. But don't say anything, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.82,0:00:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓不说  人格担保\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I swear. I promise. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  我超兴奋的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My God, I'm so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:37.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你说  记得不要送她花\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, listen let me tell you, do not get her flowers. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.66,0:00:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为花谢了  她会哭  还会帮花办葬礼之类的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because y'know, she cries when they die, and there's the whole funeral
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.54,0:00:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  下班后再见  好  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll see you after work, sweetie. Okay. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.34,0:00:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该去看什么电影\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, what movie should we see?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.96,0:00:52.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盖瑞要请你搬过去跟他住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Gary's gonna ask you to move in with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.05,0:00:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  真的吗  他刚才在吧台上跟我说的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Really? He just told me at the counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.47,0:01:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他要我保证不会说出去  但我实在是憋不住了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He made me promise not to tell but I couldn't hold it in any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.93,0:01:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信  对  因为太快了  太快\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe this. Right? Because it's fast. Because it's so fast. It's fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.73,0:01:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别激动  是菲比  又不是你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Relax. It's Phoebe, not you. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.82,0:01:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  很厉害  有一套\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good for you, Pheebs. Way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.15,0:01:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过真的是很快  对吧  才不是呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, but it is fast, isn't it? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.86,0:01:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是很喜欢他  没错  但我还没有准备好要同居\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I like him a lot but I don't think I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.74,0:01:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你打算怎么办  不知道  兵来将挡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, what are you gonna do? I don't know. I'll just handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.33,0:01:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干脆找你去疏通他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll ask you to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.95,0:01:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我   为何是我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me? Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.12,0:01:26.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为给予承诺  你最怕了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because you are so afraid of commitment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去跟他说说  让他也跟你一样怕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You talk to him. Make him scared like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.33,0:01:30.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他成为一个  男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}make him a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.25,0:01:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会去试试   但我不确定会多有用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll try, but I'm not sure what good it would do...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.13,0:01:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为比起以前  我现在已经很不害怕承诺了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because I'm less afraid of commitment than I used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是太甜蜜了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.47,0:01:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是很怕  但我会处理  没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Still terrified. I'll take care of it no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.77,0:01:49.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第五季  第21集  掷球游戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S05E21  The One With The Ball
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.03,0:02:00.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.74,0:02:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.88,0:02:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.76,0:02:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.59,0:02:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.03,0:02:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯   斯塔顿岛真的是岛吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Ross, is, uh, Staten Island really an island?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.32,0:02:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  所以才叫斯塔顿〝岛〞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-huh. That's why they call it Staten "Island."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.29,0:02:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为那跟长岛一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I thought it was like Long Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.67,0:02:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,长岛也是岛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Also an island.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.05,0:02:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几点了  2点17分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, what time is it? Two seventeen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.97,0:03:01.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  我们丢这个球\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, you realize we've been throwing this ball
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连续一小时都没有漏接落地\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}without dropping it for an hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.47,0:03:05.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.64,0:03:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我半小时前就发现了  我怕坏了好事才没说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I realized it a half-hour ago, but I didn't wanna say anything because I didn't wanna jinx it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.14,0:03:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  我们还真会丢接球呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, we are pretty good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.32,0:03:16.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们完全忘了吃午饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, we totally forgot about lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.53,0:03:19.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我第一次忘记吃饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think that's the first time I've ever missed a meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.28,0:03:23.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我的裤子都有点松了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, my pants are a little loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.16,0:03:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  两位  摩妮卡在吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you guys. Uh, is Monica here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.87,0:03:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不在  不在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.08,0:03:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我带了东西回来  我不确定她会喜欢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right listen umm, I just bought something I'm not sure she's gonna like it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.17,0:03:35.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起有点奇怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And it's gonna seem crazy...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.79,0:03:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个东西我从小就想要了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but this is something I've wanted since I was a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.30,0:03:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你带史恩卡希迪来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You bought Shaun Cassidy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.26,0:03:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  我也希望是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.63,0:03:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们准备好了没   好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you ready? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.72,0:03:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}OK
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.60,0:03:50.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.02,0:03:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是啥啊  什么鬼东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. What is it? What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.65,0:04:00.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是猫啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.99,0:04:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这才不是猫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is not a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.74,0:04:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是猫啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.32,0:04:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的皮怎么翻出来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why is it inside out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.46,0:04:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可是展示级的  纯种狮身人面猫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but this is a purebred, show-quality sphinx cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.54,0:04:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你花了多少钱买的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How much did you pay for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.09,0:04:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点奢侈  但我谈到了很好的价钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it was a little extravagant, but I got a pretty good deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.63,0:04:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  多少钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, how much?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.01,0:04:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一千美元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A thousand bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.72,0:04:28.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,买一只猫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}On a cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.22,0:04:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那才不是猫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.68,0:04:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这两个玩球的  给我听好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Listen, ball boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.73,0:04:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我小时候祖母就养了这种猫  他们最讨人喜欢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My grandmother had one of these when I was little. and it was the sweetest thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.57,0:04:41.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,超可爱的  躺在我的膝盖上  整天满足地喵喵叫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, it was so cute, it would sit in my lap and just purr all day long...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.11,0:04:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还会拿鞋带在地上拖  让他追着跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I would drag a shoe string on the ground and it would chase it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.07,0:04:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要钱的猫也会那样啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Free cats do that too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.07,0:04:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那才不是猫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,反正我买得很兴奋  我才不管你们怎么想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, guys, I'm really excited about this, okay? I don't care what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.91,0:04:56.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去帮威丝克森太太   张罗出一个小猫砂盒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna go set up a little litter box for Mrs. Whiskerson.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.59,0:05:01.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不然我要叫他〝毛毛〞吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, what am I gonna call her? Fluffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要去吃点东西吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, do you wanna get something to eat
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.26,0:05:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是要看我们能来回丢多久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}or, uh..do you wanna see how long we can throw this ball back and forth? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.64,0:05:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续丢球  是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, the ball thing. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.98,0:05:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  若我们连丢两小时不落地  那样是不是很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Ross, wouldn't it be great if we could go for like two straight hours without dropping it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.32,0:05:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, yeah, it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.49,0:05:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's do it. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.16,0:05:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-oh. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.37,0:05:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要尿尿  但瑞秋在厕所里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have to pee. And Rachel's in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.04,0:05:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没想到这样也行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man, I didn't think we were gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.42,0:05:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:45.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你别换手喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't switch hands, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小姐们  你们在这里干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, ladies. What are you in here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.69,0:06:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  你来这里干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Chandler, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.07,0:06:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盖瑞  我是来报案的  是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Gary, I am here to report a crime. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.48,0:06:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们俩不常聚在一起  是一种罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It is a crime that you and I don't spend more time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:08.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha, ha. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.12,0:06:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听说你在考虑要菲比跟你同居\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, well, I heard that you were thinking about asking Phoebe to move in with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.87,0:06:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我心想我们或许应该聊聊  男人跟我的对话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I thought maybe we should have a talk, you know, man to... well, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.16,0:06:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在发什么神经\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.04,0:06:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了  若你和菲比同居  你们两个就会住在一起了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you insane? If you live with Phoebe, you two are gonna be, you know, living together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.43,0:06:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我考虑过了  我知道这会让我快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I considered that. I just know it'd make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.34,0:06:33.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说害怕吧  不  我是说快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh. You mean scared. No, I mean happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.89,0:06:35.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,害怕  快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Scared happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.52,0:06:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  你在干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.85,0:06:40.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在让你张开眼睛啊  你看不出来吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am trying to open your eyes, my man! Don't you see,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.23,0:06:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,若你和菲比同居  她就永远都会在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}if you lived with Phoebe she's always gonna be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.73,0:06:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你回家会看到她  你上床也会看到她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're gonna get home, she's there. You go to bed, she's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.94,0:06:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你起床呢  对  她还是在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You wake up and oh, yes, she's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:51.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我都等不及了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.62,0:06:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你父母的婚姻很幸福  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Were your parents happy or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.08,0:06:59.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  我看这件事的角度是  我很幸运能找到我的真爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, Chandler, the way I see it. I was lucky enough to find someone that I really love.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.37,0:07:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要尽量多跟她在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just wanna be around her as much as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.79,0:07:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怪了  这件事从你嘴里说出来  感觉就没那么恐怖了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, you know, when you say it, it doesn't sound so scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.71,0:07:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你懂我的意思吧   对  我想我懂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you know what I'm talking about? Yeah, I think I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.26,0:07:11.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样吧  跟她同居\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? You move in with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.84,0:07:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马上  就去跟她同居\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You move in right with her right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.76,0:07:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我也应该和摩妮卡同居\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe I should move in with Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.06,0:07:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不成  你们不能操之过急\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, it's too soon for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.60,0:07:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你说的对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, you're right about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.90,0:07:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们找到中生代乳齿象化石\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}…now when they found the remains of the Mesozoic mastodon...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.90,0:07:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却在嘴部发现到  类似古生代两栖类的构造\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...they discovered what appeared to be the remains of a Paleozoic amphibian in its jaws.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.16,0:07:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会牛头不对马嘴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How did it get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.29,0:07:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许这个游戏应该安静一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe this should be more of a quiet game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.12,0:07:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, guys. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.33,0:07:46.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  我昨晚把手表放在柜子上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, I left my watch on the counter last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.88,0:07:48.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本来还在这里  到哪儿去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} It was right here, Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.38,0:07:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  别闹了  我上班快迟到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. Well, come on, I'm late for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.88,0:07:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道  你又没戴表\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How do you know? You don't have a watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.93,0:07:58.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们能不能停一下再丢球  先帮我找表\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Guys, could you stop throwing the ball for one minute and just help me find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.52,0:08:00.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  没办法喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I don't know. Yeah, can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.52,0:08:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.69,0:08:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样都好  千万别把球掉地上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whatever you do, do not drop that ball
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.07,0:08:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们保持球不落地已经\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, we haven't dropped it in...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.44,0:08:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,2小时27分钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Two hours, 27 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.03,0:08:15.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.49,0:08:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我今天没办法去上班  我人不太舒服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not gonna be able to make it in to work today. Um, I don't feel very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.91,0:08:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.50,0:08:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚才突然觉得自己好多了  但其实没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, uh, for a second there, I thought I was feeling better, but I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.67,0:08:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rach. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.05,0:08:35.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快来看  球不落地接近三小时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Check it out. Almost three hours without dropping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.68,0:08:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜了  真是浪费时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, congratulations. That's quite a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.27,0:08:42.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.60,0:08:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你身上都是抓痕  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have scratches all over you. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.60,0:08:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我的猫  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it's my cat. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.11,0:08:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  我养了只猫  我不想养猫了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah, I got a cat. I don't want a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.40,0:08:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心  那不是猫  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, don't worry, it's not a cat. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.11,0:08:56.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这只猫跟我祖母养过的猫  完全不一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You guys, this cat is nothing like my grandmother's cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.45,0:08:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既不讨人喜欢  也不可爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not sweet. It's not cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:09:01.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在地上拉着线逗他玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I even dragged a string on the ground...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.66,0:09:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他竟然发飙  把我抓得乱七八糟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and it just flipped out and scratched the hell out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.71,0:09:07.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这听来很疯狂  但我发誓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I swear... I know this sounds crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.67,0:09:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这只猫每次嘘我的时候  我知道他都在说〝瑞秋〞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but every time this cat hisses at me I know it's saying, "Rachel."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.89,0:09:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,花一千美元买一只猫  比刚才那些话更疯狂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Doesn't sound as crazy as paying $1000 for a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.89,0:09:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你欠我三百美元不还  还拿一千美元去买猫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You paid $1000 for a cat when you owe me 300?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.83,0:09:29.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来打算让你跟他玩的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I was gonna let you play with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.40,0:09:34.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.40,0:09:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.57,0:09:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟盖瑞聊过同居的事没\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hmm, Did you talk to Gary about the moving in thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,聊过了  我觉得你应该答应\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, I did, and I think you should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.58,0:09:41.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.99,0:09:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他很棒  他也很爱你  你非常幸运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's a great guy, y'know? and he loves you a lot. You are a very lucky lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.33,0:09:49.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真没用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,害怕承诺是你唯一会做的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Freaking out about commitment is the one thing you can do...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.21,0:09:55.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你竟然连那件事都做不好  天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The one thing! And you can't even do that right! God!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.97,0:09:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.55,0:09:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,换做我都愿意和他同居\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If he asked me, I'd move in with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.85,0:10:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,窝囊废  你滚吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}get out of here, good-for-nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.85,0:10:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  钱德  嘿  盖瑞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Chandler. Hey, Gar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.52,0:10:12.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.15,0:10:15.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能不能先聊下  好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I talk to you for a second? Yeah. .
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.19,0:10:17.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.28,0:10:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你今天很美\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You look very pretty today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.57,0:10:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.87,0:10:23.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是这样的  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here's the thing. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.12,0:10:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很想让这段关系更进一步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I really want this relationship to move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.41,0:10:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为不进则退\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because if you're not moving forward, you know, you're just moving backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.75,0:10:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是那样的  真的  如果不进  就是静止不动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, that's not true. If you're not moving forward, you're staying still.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.25,0:10:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,静止不动是很好的  你看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And staying still is good. Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.18,0:10:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.39,0:10:43.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你搬来一起住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want you to move in with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.64,0:10:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那真是太甜蜜了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.72,0:10:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你不觉得稍微太快了点吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But don't you think that it's a little it's too soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.43,0:10:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们彼此  还有很多地方并不太了解\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, there's so much we don't know about each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.48,0:10:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我懂了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, okay. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:11:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是  不希望我们操之过急  你懂吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just—I don't want us to jump into something that we're not ready for, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.79,0:11:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想搞砸我们现在的一切\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I really don't want to mess up what we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.37,0:11:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我担心同居会铸成大错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just—I'm worried it's gonna be a big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.96,0:11:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.92,0:11:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我的答案是  我答应\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which is why my answer is yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.59,0:11:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.51,0:11:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好高兴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-huh! You're so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.93,0:11:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  别用那么大力气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, stop throwing it so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.27,0:11:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是同一队\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're on the same team.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.90,0:11:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,四个小时  你们就这样丢了四小时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Four hours? You guys have been doing this for four hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.90,0:11:42.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.24,0:11:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  让我加入  不  不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Let me in. No, no. Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.87,0:11:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.37,0:11:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是漏球大王\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's a dropper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.00,0:11:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.25,0:11:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不是漏球大王\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not a dropper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.21,0:11:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这其实是三个人的游戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's really a three-person game, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.47,0:12:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不就是你丢我接\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's throwing and catching.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.30,0:12:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.72,0:12:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  好难啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, oh, it's so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.40,0:12:19.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张  那不是猫啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't worry, guys. It's not a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.40,0:12:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的  天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my... Oh, good God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.16,0:12:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我放弃了  我不知道要怎么处理这玩意儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I give up, you guys. I don't know what I'm gonna do with this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.74,0:12:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,送他进烤箱也没用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Baking it didn't help, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.16,0:12:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,送回你买的地方呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't you just take it back to where you got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.63,0:12:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我试过了  他们不收\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I tried. They won't take her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.59,0:12:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许是因为他是反基督的爪牙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe that's because she's a minion of the Antichrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.76,0:12:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  店家为什么不收\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, why won't they take it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.30,0:12:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们说要收回可以  但只退我店里的购物券\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, they said they would, but would only give me store credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.89,0:12:51.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我用它来买什么呢   一千只普通的猫不成\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What am I gonna do, get a thousand regular cats?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.85,0:12:54.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不然你先留着  等到你找到处理的方法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you want, you can keep it until you find out what to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:55.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  那不是重点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, Mon, that's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:12:58.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我花费一千美元  却搞得全身都是抓痕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm out a thousand dollars.I'm all scratched up
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.90,0:13:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还跟长得像手的蠢猫困在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I'm stuck with this stupid cat that looks like a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.12,0:13:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  那只猫害我流眼泪了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. The cat's made my eyes water.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.49,0:13:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别给我丢球\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't throw it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.24,0:13:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的视力受损了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My vision's been compromised.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.12,0:13:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God. Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.13,0:13:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在好了  真是惊险\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's okay. Man, that was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.59,0:13:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你的反应也太大了点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, you almost overreacted to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.47,0:13:30.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有个好消息  我们要同居了  是不是很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have great news. We're moving in together. Isn't it great?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.35,0:13:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜  是啊  我好兴奋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Congratulations. That's great.I know, I'm so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.81,0:13:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.98,0:13:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你才没有我兴奋  不可能  我是最兴奋的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you're not more excited than I am. No way. I'm the most excited. Ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.81,0:13:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  晚点在局里见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I'll see you at the station later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.44,0:13:44.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  晚点见  别忘了同居的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, yeah, I'll see you later. Don't forget about the moving-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.99,0:13:47.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要搬去跟他住  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you're moving in with him? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.86,0:13:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不忍心拒绝他  看他伤心成那样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I couldn't tell him no. He got so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.53,0:13:52.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许不会有事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But maybe it'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.37,0:13:57.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很喜欢他  同居八成也是迟早的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I do really like him a lot. and probably do it eventually anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.29,0:14:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想想也可以省下不少邮票钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And plus, think of all the money I'll save on stamps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.96,0:14:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么着  你常写信给他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why, do you write him a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.59,0:14:07.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  只是我听说同居的人  会分担邮票的费用  不是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I just heard when people live together, they split the cost of stamps. Don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.97,0:14:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, yeah. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.98,0:14:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  耐热手套吓了我一跳\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I'm sorry, the oven mitts really freaked me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.94,0:14:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  亲爱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你找到公寓没有  布鲁克林高地有吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so did you find any apartments? Anything in Brooklyn Heights?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.78,0:14:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  没找到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.41,0:14:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, really? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.79,0:14:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问都没有  没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nothing at all? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.95,0:14:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要有公寓招租  我们马上搬进去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}As soon as something opens up, we'll move right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.58,0:14:39.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过要有附泳池的  我需要泳池\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unless it doesn't have a pool. I need a pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.83,0:14:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  可以跟你聊一下吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, can I talk to you for a second? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.22,0:14:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请坐  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Take a seat. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.13,0:14:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧  还好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You okay? You feel all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.10,0:14:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很好啊  因为我们要同居了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I feel great because we're moving in together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.89,0:15:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,报上布鲁克林高地的租屋广告  你都看过了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you, uh.You checked the paper for listings in Brooklyn Heights, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.36,0:15:06.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《邮报》你有查过吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You-you checked the Post?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.57,0:15:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有查啊  啥都没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, uh-huh, there was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.32,0:15:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能喝点水吗   等下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I get some water? In a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.49,0:15:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你查过今天的《邮报》吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You checked today's Post?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.49,0:15:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我是看今天的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, yeah, today's.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.91,0:15:21.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是今天的《邮报》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hmm. Because, uh, this is today's Post.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.83,0:15:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我找到了这些租屋广告\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, uh, these are the listings I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.17,0:15:26.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布鲁克林高地  两房\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Brooklyn Heights, two bedrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.84,0:15:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布鲁克林高地  一房\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Brooklyn Heights, one bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.34,0:15:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布鲁克林高地区  布鲁克林高地区  布鲁克林高地区\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Brooklyn Heights, Brooklyn Heights, Brooklyn Heights.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.14,0:15:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些是要租的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, are these for rent?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.30,0:15:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为他们是在炫耀自己的房子有多棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought people were just bragging.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.47,0:15:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来告诉你  我的想法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me tell you what I think might be going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.98,0:15:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要看桌子  看着我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, don't look at the table. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.27,0:15:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  一个男生要求一个女生同居\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I think somebody asked someone to move in with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.57,0:15:48.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女生本来说好  现在反悔了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I think someone said yes, but now she's having doubts...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.15,0:15:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为女生觉得这样太快了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because things are moving too fast for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.32,0:15:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得是不是这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Does that sound at all possible to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.78,0:15:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  好  我就是那个女生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, yes. Yes, fine, I am someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.29,0:16:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我说老实话  对  我是不确定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want me to say it? I have doubts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.88,0:16:07.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.96,0:16:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你有这种感觉也没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, it's okay that you feel this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.55,0:16:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这真的是很快  我们彼此有许多地方不了解\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, it is soon, and there's a lot of things we don't know about each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.80,0:16:17.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是觉得  我知道的你  我都很喜欢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just figured everything I know about you, I really like.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.22,0:16:21.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还不知道的你  就等同居后再慢慢了解\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The things I don't know, I get to learn in a place with both our names on the mailbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.73,0:16:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样好甜蜜啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.90,0:16:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sweetheart,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:28.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你觉得这样太快了  就不行的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but none of that matters if it's too soon for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.94,0:16:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也不用赶着现在就同居  我只要你快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's fine. We don't have to move in together. I just want you to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你同居会让我快乐的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Living with you would make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.53,0:16:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你不用那样说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, you don't have to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.87,0:16:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我很想跟你住在一起  我要跟你同居\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I really wanna live with you. I wanna move in with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.91,0:16:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.08,0:16:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  百分之百确定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. Definitely, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.46,0:16:44.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起住在公寓同居吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's live in an apartment that we both live in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.83,0:16:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.96,0:16:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wait, one sec. One sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.50,0:16:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,镜子后面的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you. Behind the glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.13,0:16:51.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看个什么劲啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.30,0:16:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我每次进来这种房间  都想说这句话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've always wanted to say that every time I was in one of these rooms...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.93,0:16:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我从没进来过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...which was never.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.81,0:17:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,展示猫   高级的展示猫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Show cat. Quality show cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.56,0:17:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,展示猫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Show cat. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.77,0:17:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  你的宝宝怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's wrong with your baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是宝宝  这是猫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not a baby. That's a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.61,0:17:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,长得还真吓人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ew, it's creepy looking. .
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  他其实很讨人喜欢的  不信你看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. no, it's actually very sweet. It's very sweet. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.16,0:17:23.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Do you want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.62,0:17:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不了  我恨死猫了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha, ha. No, I hate cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.12,0:17:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你干嘛跟我扯半天  滚吧  继续走你的路\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, so then what are you doing to me? Okay? Just get out of here, all right? Move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.96,0:17:33.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jeez
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.17,0:17:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这只猫真不寻常\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, what an unusual cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.84,0:17:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  谢谢你  真的是这样  你要吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, thank you. Exactly. You want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.05,0:17:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有可能  我考虑要养猫  我正好要去流浪动物之家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe. I was thinking about getting a cat. I was just gonna go to the shelter, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  就他了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.23,0:17:46.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  总共是两千美元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, terrific. That'll be $2,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.69,0:17:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么   好吧  一千\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha. What? Okay, a thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.11,0:17:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你是要我认养你的猫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought you wanted me to adopt your cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.98,0:17:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  不过这不只是猫  更是像是一项投资\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I do, but you're gonna have to look at this as more of an investment than a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.70,0:17:59.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我要的只是猫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, yeah. I just wanted a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.49,0:18:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你显然是杀价高手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Obviously, you know how to haggle...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.66,0:18:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我就不唬弄你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so I'm not gonna try and take you on, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.96,0:18:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算你八百  我也不报警了  因为你这根本是抢劫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So $800, and I don't call the copswhich I should because you are robbing me blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.04,0:18:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把钱留下  猫带走  溜之大吉吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Blind. Just take the cat, leave the money and run away. Just run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.97,0:18:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Damn it. Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.51,0:18:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死猫  你起码也笑一下嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can't you at least smile or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.22,0:18:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有人听到  谁听到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, did anybody just hear that? Anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.90,0:18:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我饿死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.19,0:18:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们振作一点  就快达成连续十小时了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, guys. Suck it up. We're closing in on 10 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.95,0:18:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是比毅力的时刻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's gut-check time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.03,0:18:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么变成是你当老大  这游戏是我们发明的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know who made you the boss. We invented this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:47.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮忙  这游戏是因为我  才有现在的局面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please. I made this game what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.62,0:18:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不再好玩的局面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not fun anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.08,0:18:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是很饿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm still hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.29,0:18:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我家还有一点比萨  你们可以用一手吃吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, there's some pizza at my place. We can eat with one hand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.38,0:18:56.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不要  我要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you with me? I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.92,0:18:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我们走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, let's go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.55,0:19:01.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡大队  走啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's go, Team Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.22,0:19:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  队名等一下再讨论\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, we can work out the name later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.60,0:19:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你的猫在我碗里干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, what is your cat doing in one of my bowls?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.31,0:19:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦  我在解冻鸡肉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not. I'm defrosting a chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.90,0:19:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把威丝克森太太卖掉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I sold, uh, Mrs. Whiskerson.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.82,0:19:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.82,0:19:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的钱拿回来没\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you get your money back?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.99,0:19:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有  一千五百美元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, $1500.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.37,0:19:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  你还有赚啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, you made a profit?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.79,0:19:30.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是来拿红丝绒枕头的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just came for the red velvet pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.79,0:19:34.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这里  瑞秋  谢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh yeah, There you go. Thanks, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.04,0:19:38.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了  你随时可以来看他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, uh, don't forget, you can come visit her any time you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.38,0:19:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我会记得的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, good. Great. I'll keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.47,0:19:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是啥  某种蛇吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahem, hey. So what is this? some kind of snake or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.65,0:20:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真喜欢和你一起醒来  我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I really like waking up with you. I like waking up with you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.24,0:20:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天早上真美\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, it's such a beautiful morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.33,0:20:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以在床上待一整天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I could stay here all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样不错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.96,0:20:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以在床上吃早餐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We could have breakfast in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.96,0:20:14.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.84,0:20:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.47,0:20:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来  摩妮卡  有活力点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Come on, Monica. Look alive. Come on, look alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.89,0:20:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  你们都起床了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, good. You're all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.77,0:20:35.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  现在才早上六点  你怎么没在盖瑞那里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, it's six o'clock in the morning. Why aren't you at Gary's?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.94,0:20:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  结束了  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. That's over. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.11,0:20:40.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样  盖瑞这么好  有什么问题都能解决的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, Gary's such a great guy. Whatever the problem, you can work it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.15,0:20:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他开枪杀了一只鸟  喔  结束了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He shot a bird. Oh, that is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.86,0:20:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太糟糕了  我很遗憾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. That's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.95,0:20:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你还好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe， Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.45,0:20:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放心  我不会有事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, yeah, I'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.79,0:20:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  菲比  接住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hey, here, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.00,0:20:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不太想玩球\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Nah, I don't feel like playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事  没事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.05,0:21:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就当没发生这件事   没必要让别人知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just pretend that it didn't happen, okay? No one needs to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.14,0:21:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比又不是正式的队员  正式队员漏球才算数\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe's not an official ball player.I mean, only official ball players can drop the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.68,0:21:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了  我好饿   走吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Okay. I'm starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.52,0:21:17.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  要吃早餐吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, honey, you wanna get breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.35,0:21:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我们来赛跑  最先到的赢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Okay. Okay, let's race. First one there wins. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.28,0:21:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们要在这里吃吗  好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You guys wanna eat here? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.20,0:21:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想起来真的很棒吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, man, that was great, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.87,0:21:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信我们丢了那么久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you believe how long we threw that ball around?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.29,0:21:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  撑了那么久  真的不可思议\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, It is amazing it lasted that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.54,0:21:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我的手臂酸死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. My arm is killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.63,0:21:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  我是说有漏球高手在  还能撑那么久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I meant with the dropper over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.51,0:21:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,〝漏球高手〞这称号  怎么会落到我头上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, how did I get this reputation as a dropper? Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.80,0:21:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我再怎么说  也不是漏球高手啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am anything but a dropper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.43,0:21:49.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross.
